    skos:scopeNote "Subdomain links approved from review sheet 6b, with review strength: Skills and Livelihoods for a Contracting Economy (firm); Cooperative and Commons-Based Ownership (possible). California Doughnut categories (sheet 2): Income & Work (closeMatch, firm). Bioregioning Earth and One Earth practices (sheet 3): Training and Employment Pathways (firm); Venture Cultivation (possible)."@en ;
    skos:closeMatch tgs:IndicatorCategory.IncomeAndWork ;
    .

tgs:DevonDoughnutDomain.PoliticalVoice a thinkr:DevonDoughnutDomain, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    skos:inScheme tgs:ConceptScheme.DevonDoughnut ;
    skos:broader tgs:DevonDoughnutDomain.SocialFoundation ;
    skos:prefLabel "Political Voice"@en ;
    skos:definition "Whether people feel heard when they speak up; youth involvement in local decisions and participatory budgeting."@en ;
