    dcterms:source tgs:Work.DevonDoughnutIndicatorCompilation ;
    skos:scopeNote "Subdomain links approved from review sheet 6b, with review strength: Deliberative and Participatory Democracy (firm); Subsidiarity and Local Governance Capacity (probable). California Doughnut categories (sheet 2): Political Voice (closeMatch, firm). Bioregioning Earth and One Earth practices (sheet 3): Participatory Strategies (firm); Decision Making Processes (probable)."@en ;
    skos:closeMatch tgs:IndicatorCategory.PoliticalVoice ;
    .

